	(text "HIGH-GAIN TIA: WE -> SUM_HI virtual ground. Range relays on output side (K1..K5).\nOff-relay leakage appears as gain error, not offset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 370 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2bc0c7dc-e093-4ae8-8e64-e8c881996cef")
	)
	(text "DRIVE: VIN -> U1. K6 ON = follower (device mode, CE driven, RE senses).\nK7 ON + K6 OFF = PI potentiostat (CE driven so V_RE = VIN). \nK8 ON = RE tied to CE on board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "56c895f5-c3b4-4523-b795-562c93f210d0")
	)
	(text "RELAY CONTROL: GPIO header -> 74HCT541 (high-side drive, 3.3 V logic OK). Off coils sit at 0 V to keep coil-contact leakage out of the summing node.\nCTL1..5 = 10k/100k/1M/10M/100M range, CTL6 = DEV, CTL7 = PSTAT, CTL8 = RE_LOCAL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 280 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76ea6ee3-4ae7-4131-80f6-90d73f789a0c")
	)
	(text "RE electrometer buffer (U2), guard driver (U3 -> GUARD BNC\nand RE BNC shell), V_OUT = V_RE/2."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "995b3f1a-1c1a-4e74-ae69-c136953cb079")
	)
	(text "POWER: external +/-15 V (bench). Reverse-protected, ferrite-filtered. +5 V for relays/logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f89df58-9489-42bc-afcf-74d150c51019")
	)
	(text "D3: antiparallel low-leakage steering diodes. Above ~ (Vsat/Rf) the hi-gain TIA saturates, SUM_HI rises ~0.6 V,\ncurrent diverts to low-gain TIA U6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 370 180 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dcc37154-fcf8-49ed-95ba-018f1e49d5f3")
	)
